# `!config/sqlfluff-teradata.cfg` used to sit here. It never did anything: no pattern above ignores a
# `.cfg`, and a negation containing a slash is anchored to THIS directory, so it could not have reached
# the plugin's copy at plugins/teradata-vantage/config/ in any case. Verified with `git check-ignore`.
# A pattern containing a slash is anchored to THIS directory, so a bare `evals/results/` would
# only match at the repository root and would commit the plugin's eval run artifacts.
**/evals/results/
